Title: The Long Drive
Credit: Written by
Author: Master Scenes Skill by Daniel Rodrigues (example only)
Draft date: 1.0.0

FADE IN:

INT. DINER - NIGHT

Rain hammers the window. MARA, 30s, wipes down a counter that
doesn't need it. The bell above the door jingles.

A stranger, TOM, steps in, shaking off the water.

MARA
We're closed.

TOM
(checking his watch)
Sign says eleven.

MARA
Sign's wrong.

Tom doesn't move. He just looks at her — a long beat.

TOM (CONT'D)
Coffee, then. Black.

Mara studies him a moment, then reaches for the pot anyway.

CUT TO:

EXT. DINER - SAME

A single car sits in the lot, engine ticking as it cools.

FADE OUT.
